      ],
      "start": 733.8,
      "end": 735.08
    },
    {
      "en": "Morning, Clara.",
      "asr_range": [
        1121,
        1123
      ],
      "start": 735.45,
      "end": 736.81
    },
    {
      "en": "How was your weekend?",
      "asr_range": [
        1123,
        1127
      ],
      "start": 737.05,
      "end": 738.33
    },
    {
      "en": "Great.",
      "asr_range": [
        1127,
        1128
      ],
      "start": 738.73,
      "end": 739.21
    },
    {
      "en": "I went to my grandpa's.",
      "asr_range": [
        1128,
        1133
      ],
      "start": 739.45,
      "end": 741.21
    },
    {
      "en": "He invited us to pick vegetables on his farm.",
      "asr_range": [
        1133,
        1142
      ],
      "start": 741.45,
      "end": 745.05
    },
    {
      "en": "My daughter had a great time there.",
      "asr_range": [
        1142,
        1149
      ],
      "start": 745.29,
      "end": 747.85
    },
    {
      "en": "What about you?",
      "asr_range": [
        1149,
        1152
      ],
      "start": 748.09,
      "end": 749.13
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh, I had a truly incredible experience.",
      "asr_range": [
        1152,
        1159
      ],
      "start": 749.53,
      "end": 753.13
    },
    {
      "en": "I dropped by a yard sale on Saturday and got several books.",
      "asr_range": [
        1159,
        1171
      ],
      "start": 753.84,
      "end": 758.8
    },
    {
      "en": "Novels?",
      "asr_range": [
        1171,
        1172
      ],
      "start": 759.76,
      "end": 760.56
    },
    {
      "en": "A novel and two poetry collections.",
      "asr_range": [
        1172,
        1178
      ],
      "start": 760.88,
      "end": 764.0
    },
    {
      "en": "As I leafed through the novel, a piece of paper fell out.",
      "asr_range": [
        1178,
        1190
      ],
      "start": 764.24,
      "end": 768.48
    },
    {
      "en": "It was an air ticket from two thousand and twelve.",
      "asr_range": [
        1190,
        1200
      ],
      "start": 769.08,
      "end": 772.36
    },
    {
      "en": "The flight was from Los Angeles to Chicago, and the name on the ticket was Ashley Louis.",
      "asr_range": [
        1200,
        1217
      ],
      "start": 772.6,
      "end": 779.64
    },
    {
      "en": "Was it?",
      "asr_range": [
        1217,
        1219
      ],
      "start": 780.2,
      "end": 780.92
    },
    {
      "en": "Yes.",
      "asr_range": [
        1219,
        1220
      ],
      "start": 781.4,
      "end": 781.8
    },
    {
      "en": "Ashley, my sister.",
      "asr_range": [
        1220,
        1223
      ],
      "start": 782.54,
      "end": 784.3
    },
    {
      "en": "In twenty twelve she lived in Los Angeles and her husband worked in Chicago.",
      "asr_range": [
        1223,
        1237
      ],
      "start": 785.34,
      "end": 792.14
    },
    {
      "en": "Both of them often flew between the two cities.",
      "asr_range": [
        1237,
        1246
      ],
      "start": 792.38,
      "end": 795.74
    },
    {
      "en": "I asked the seller where he got the book.",
      "asr_range": [
        1246,
        1255
      ],
      "start": 796.5,
      "end": 799.54
    },
    {
      "en": "He said it was bought at a second-hand bookstore in Los Angeles three years ago.",
      "asr_range": [
        1255,
        1272
      ],
      "start": 799.78,
      "end": 806.18
    },
    {
      "en": "Last year he and his family moved from Los Angeles to Philadelphia.",
      "asr_range": [
        1272,
        1284
      ],
      "start": 806.42,
      "end": 812.34
    },
    {
      "en": "So all the way across the country your sister's old book landed in your hands.",
      "asr_range": [
        1284,
        1299
      ],
      "start": 813.45,
      "end": 819.45
    },
    {
      "en": "That's really crazy.",
      "asr_range": [
        1299,
        1302
      ],
      "start": 819.69,
      "end": 821.45
    },
    {
      "en": "Morning, Mark.",
      "asr_range": [
        1302,
        1304
      ],
      "start": 823.93,
      "end": 824.97
    },
    {
      "en": "Morning, Clara.",
      "asr_range": [
        1304,
        1306
      ],
      "start": 825.58,
      "end": 826.94
    },
    {
      "en": "How was your weekend?",
      "asr_range": [
        1306,
        1310
      ],
      "start": 827.18,
      "end": 828.46
    },
    {
      "en": "Great.",
      "asr_range": [
        1310,
        1311
      ],
      "start": 828.86,
      "end": 829.34
    },
    {
      "en": "I went to my grandpa's.",
      "asr_range": [
        1311,
        1316
      ],
      "start": 829.58,
      "end": 831.34
    },
    {
      "en": "He invited us to pick vegetables on his farm.",
      "asr_range": [
        1316,
        1325
      ],
      "start": 831.58,
      "end": 835.18
    },
    {
      "en": "My daughter had a great time there.",
      "asr_range": [
        1325,
        1332
      ],
      "start": 835.42,
      "end": 837.98
    },
    {
      "en": "What about you?",
      "asr_range": [
        1332,
        1335
      ],
      "start": 838.22,
      "end": 839.26
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh, I had a truly incredible experience.",
      "asr_range": [
        1335,
        1342
      ],
      "start": 839.66,
      "end": 843.18
    },
    {
      "en": "I dropped by a yard sale on Saturday and got several books.",
      "asr_range": [
        1342,
        1354
      ],
      "start": 843.98,
      "end": 848.94
    },
    {
      "en": "Novels?",
      "asr_range": [
        1354,
        1355
      ],
      "start": 849.9,
      "end": 850.78
    },
    {
      "en": "A novel and two poetry collections.",
      "asr_range": [
        1355,
        1361
      ],
      "start": 851.02,
      "end": 854.14
    },
    {
      "en": "As I leafed through the novel, a piece of paper fell out.",
      "asr_range": [
        1361,
        1373
      ],
      "start": 854.38,
      "end": 858.62
    },
    {
      "en": "It was an air ticket from two thousand and twelve.",
      "asr_range": [
        1373,
        1383
      ],
      "start": 859.2,
      "end": 862.48
    },
    {
      "en": "The flight was from Los Angeles to Chicago, and the name on the ticket was Ashley Louis.",
      "asr_range": [
        1383,
        1400
      ],
      "start": 862.72,
      "end": 869.76
    },
    {
      "en": "Was it?",
      "asr_range": [
        1400,
        1402
      ],
      "start": 870.4,
      "end": 871.28
    },
    {
      "en": "Yes.",
      "asr_range": [
        1402,
        1403
      ],
      "start": 871.52,
      "end": 871.92
    },
    {
      "en": "Ashley, my sister.",
      "asr_range": [
        1403,
        1406
      ],
      "start": 872.67,
      "end": 874.43
    },
    {
      "en": "In twenty twelve she lived in Los Angeles and her husband worked in Chicago.",
      "asr_range": [
        1406,
        1420
      ],
      "start": 875.47,
      "end": 882.27
    },
    {
      "en": "Both of them often flew between the two cities.",
      "asr_range": [
        1420,
        1429
      ],
      "start": 882.51,
      "end": 885.87
    },
    {
      "en": "I asked the seller where he got the book.",
      "asr_range": [
        1429,
        1438
      ],
      "start": 886.63,
      "end": 889.67
    },
    {
      "en": "He said it was bought at a second-hand bookstore in Los Angeles three years ago.",
      "asr_range": [
        1438,
        1455
      ],
      "start": 889.91,
      "end": 896.31
    },
    {
      "en": "Last year he and his family moved from Los Angeles to Philadelphia.",
      "asr_range": [
        1455,
        1467
      ],
      "start": 896.55,
      "end": 902.47
    },
    {
      "en": "So all the way across the country your sister's old book landed in your hands.",
      "asr_range": [
        1467,
        1482
      ],
      "start": 903.59,
      "end": 909.67
    },
    {
      "en": "That's really crazy.",
      "asr_range": [
        1482,
        1485
      ],
      "start": 909.91,
      "end": 911.59
    },
    {
      "en": "Victor, you've been here in Indiana for six weeks now.",
      "asr_range": [
        1485,
        1495
      ],
      "start": 972.45,
      "end": 977.17
    },
    {
      "en": "How are you feeling?",
      "asr_range": [
        1495,
        1499
      ],
      "start": 977.41,
      "end": 978.53
    },
    {
      "en": "I think I've got used to college life, going to classes, working out and hanging out with my friends.",
      "asr_range": [
        1499,
        1518
      ],
      "start": 979.01,
      "end": 987.34
    },
    {
      "en": "Though there's pressure to meet deadlines, life here is never boring.",
      "asr_range": [
        1518,
        1529
      ],
      "start": 987.58,
      "end": 993.02
    },
    {
      "en": "What's been hard about being an Indiana basketball player?",
      "asr_range": [
        1529,
        1538
      ],
      "start": 993.58,
      "end": 997.42
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, the training is very competitive: weightlifting and running every day.",
      "asr_range": [
        1538,
        1549
      ],
      "start": 997.66,
      "end": 1004.61
    },
    {
      "en": "It's not like high school.",
      "asr_range": [
        1549,
        1554
      ],
      "start": 1004.85,
      "end": 1007.01
    },
    {
      "en": "In high school I really didn't have to do that.",
      "asr_range": [
        1554,
        1564
      ],
      "start": 1007.25,
      "end": 1010.69
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm just trying to get used to it.",
      "asr_range": [
        1564,
        1572
      ],
      "start": 1011.44,
      "end": 1014.0
    },
    {
      "en": "And I think I am.",
      "asr_range": [
        1572,
        1577
      ],
      "start": 1014.24,
      "end": 1016.32
    },
    {
      "en": "At this point, how do you see yourself fitting into this group?",
      "asr_range": [
        1577,
        1589
      ],
      "start": 1016.88,
      "end": 1021.2
    },
    {
      "en": "I think we are all different.",
      "asr_range": [
        1589,
        1595
      ],
      "start": 1021.68,
      "end": 1023.84
    },
    {
      "en": "George is from Britain, Chris and Leo are from Australia, I'm from France, and the rest are Americans.",
      "asr_range": [
        1595,
        1613
      ],
      "start": 1024.62,
      "end": 1033.34
    },
    {
      "en": "But I get along with everybody.",
      "asr_range": [
        1613,
        1619
      ],
      "start": 1033.58,
      "end": 1035.98
    },
    {
      "en": "You know, we are really starting to bond.",
      "asr_range": [
        1619,
        1627
      ],
      "start": 1036.22,
      "end": 1039.39
    },
    {
      "en": "It's great to see how we grow each day as a team.",
      "asr_range": [
        1627,
        1639
      ],
      "start": 1039.63,
      "end": 1042.59
    },
    {
      "en": "Thanks, Victor.",
      "asr_range": [
        1639,
        1641
      ],
      "start": 1042.99,
      "end": 1044.27
    },
    {
      "en": "I wish you a very happy and fruitful stay in Indiana.",
